Z||000000||FieroPerformance||06-15-2001||01:24 PM||||I got a free disposable camera at prom so I thought I would use it to take pics of my car. I took 27 total. It was a crappy camera so the pics don't look very normal but o well.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroperformance.com/car_back_2.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroperformance.com/car_front_grass.jpg">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroperformance.com/car_side_grass1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroperformance.com/car_engine_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroperformance.com/car_interior_2.jpg"> <P>My dad and I recently took most of the engine apart to replace the gaskets in an atempt to stop a really bad oil leak. It didn't stop the leak but it did give me a chance to paint all of the parts red again.<P>I hope those work.<BR>-Charlie<BR>-----<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com<BR><p>[This message has been edited by FieroPerformance (edited 06-15-2001).]||||reg||4
